<title>POLAND: AMERBANK FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.70 vs    0.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.16 vs    0.68</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.10 vs    2.68</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.09 vs    3.72</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.64 vs    1.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.73 vs    1.66</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  8.41 vs    5.82</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	10.42 vs    7.85</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
